 best film?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Palme d''Or","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Golden Shell","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Caméra d''Or","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Golden Bear","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"The Golden Bear nods to the bear on the coat of arms of Berlin."},{"id":"q7","question":"Which Spanish festival, founded in 1953, awards the Golden Shell?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"San Sebastián","is_correct":true},{"id":"b","text":"Málaga","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Valladolid","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Sitges","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"The San Sebastián festival''s top prize is the Concha de Oro, named after La Concha bay."},{"id":"q8","question":"On which famous boulevard does the Cannes festival take place?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Champs-Élysées","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Via Veneto","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"La Croisette","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Hollywood Boulevard","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"The Palais des Festivals stands on La Croisette, the waterfront boulevard of Cannes."}]'::jsonb,
  null,
